  improve: Group secondary detail and keep the primary workflow visible.
test/03_system/feature/usage/math_blocks_spec.spl:1:1: advice SSDOC-MNT-007 [maintainability] (-10): research, plan, architecture, or design metadata links are incomplete
  why: Reviewers need selected lifecycle evidence, not inferred project state.
  improve: Link the selected lifecycle artifacts or configure a reasoned scope suppression.
test/03_system/feature/usage/math_blocks_spec.spl:1:1: advice SSDOC-ORA-003 [oracle] (-30): 12 unexplained numeric expected value(s)
  why: Reviewers need to know why a magic expected value is authoritative.
  improve: Name the authoritative expected value or add a '# oracle:' explanation.
